# mod-custom-spells: the Hunter spells of the concept revision of 2026-10-08
# (share-public custom-spells/09-concept-revision-20261008.md) on a bot. Every
# check states the revised concept, so a FAIL marks a defect, not a typo.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018: take 0 damage, never die, the combat log still reads the full
# amount; each one faces the ring's middle) on a 3.9-yd circle around
# (-270, 150). The hunter shoots from 15 yd west of the west-most dummy d1
# (-273.9, 150), facing the ring.
# Gear: the slot-4 dwarf hunter's Worn Battleaxe (12282, a two-handed axe:
# the melee weapon for Raptor Strike and Blade Readiness) and Old Blunderbuss
# (2508); Light Shot 2516 is its ammo (see cs_hunter: the stack must never
# run dry, the cleanup leaves 1000).
# Hit rolls: Song of Sylvanas 59756 (no miss) and NPC Hit Buffs 62627
# (expertise: no dodge or parry) on the hunter where a roll would decide a
# check (.aura lands at the next update: waitfor it).
# Pet: the Snow Tracker Wolf (1138) cs_hunter tames (saved with the character;
# `tame` does nothing when the bot has one).
# Spells: Auto Shot 75, Multi-Shot 49048, Serpent Sting 49001 (rank 12),
# Chimera Shot 53209 (talent), Aimed Shot 49050 (rank 9), Raptor Strike 48996
# (rank 11), Explosive Trap 49067 -> Explosive Trap Effect 49065 (rank 6).
# New/changed: 900507 Pet Health (pet aura 900508), 900537 Multi-Shot ->
# Serpent Sting, 900538 / 900539 Chimera Shot +9 targets / +50 %, 900540
# Running Aim (buff 900541), 900566 explosive trap on any physical damage,
# 900568 Blade and Shot (buffs 900569 / 900570), 900571 / 900572 Raptor Strike
# +9 targets / +50 %.
name    Custom spells - Hunter revision 2026-10-08
timeout 300s

bot hu hunter slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require hu alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near hu
require d1 exists
do gm target hu
as gm .unlearn 900500
as gm .unlearn 900501
as gm .unlearn 900502
as gm .unlearn 900503
as gm .unlearn 900504
as gm .unlearn 900507
as gm .unlearn 900533
as gm .unlearn 900534
as gm .unlearn 900537
as gm .unlearn 900538
as gm .unlearn 900539
as gm .unlearn 900540
as gm .unlearn 900566
as gm .unlearn 900568
as gm .unlearn 900571
as gm .unlearn 900572
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
as gm .unaura 900541
as gm .unaura 900569
as gm .unaura 900570
as gm .unaura 3045
do hu learn 75
do hu learn 49048
do hu learn 49001
do hu learn 53209
do hu learn 49050
do hu learn 48996
do hu learn 49067
do hu destroy 2516
as gm .additem 2516 1000
expect hu item 2516 == 1000
do hu tame 1138
waitfor hu pet timeout 5s
pick pt creature:1138 near hu
require pt exists
track pt
do hu approach d1 15
as gm .aura 59756
as gm .aura 62627
waitfor hu aura 62627 timeout 2s
wait 1s

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Beast Mastery
log BM - 900507 Pet Health +100 %: spell_pet_auras (900507 -> 900508) makes the core put 900508 (aura 133, +100 % health) on the pet; its health doubles (it keeps its share)
mark m0
do hu learn 900507
waitfor pt aura 900508 timeout 3s
expect pt health > mark:m0

log BM - unlearning the passive takes 900508 off the pet again
as gm .unlearn 900507
waitfor pt noaura 900508 timeout 3s

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Marksmanship
log MM - control for 900537: without it a Multi-Shot (3 targets) applies no Serpent Sting
spelllog start
do hu cast 49048 on d1 triggered
wait 2s
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 49048 hits >= 2
expect hu spell 49001 casts == 0

log MM - 900537 Multi-Shot applies Serpent Sting: every enemy the Multi-Shot hits gets the highest rank the hunter knows (49001), each one once
do hu learn 900537
spelllog start
do hu cast 49048 on d1 triggered
wait 2s
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 49048 hits >= 2
expect hu spell 49001 casts >= 2
expect hu spell 49001 casts <= 3
expect d1 aura 49001
as gm .unlearn 900537

log MM - 900538 / 900539 Chimera Shot +9 targets (jump targets 0 -> 10: ten in all) and +50 % damage
do hu learn 900538
do hu learn 900539
expect hu spellmod 53209 jumptargets 0 == 10
expect hu spellmod 53209 damage 100 == 150
spelllog start
do hu cast 53209 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 53209 maxtargets >= 6
expect hu spell 53209 hits <= 8
as gm .unlearn 900538
as gm .unlearn 900539

log MM - 900540 Running Aim: every 5 s of movement give a stack of 900541 - four 14-yd runs of about 2 s each (8 s in all): one stack
do hu learn 900540
as gm .unaura 900541
# the no-miss aura 59756 (Song of Sylvanas) also gives +100 % run speed: without it
# a 14-yd run takes 2 s
as gm .unaura 59756
waitfor hu noaura 59756 timeout 2s
do hu goto -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do hu walk -302.9 150 -423.2
wait 2100ms
do hu walk -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 2100ms
do hu walk -302.9 150 -423.2
wait 2100ms
do hu walk -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 2100ms
expect hu aurastacks 900541 == 1

log MM - 900540 standing still adds no stack
wait 6s
expect hu aurastacks 900541 == 1

log MM - 900540 an Aimed Shot below 5 stacks strikes its target only and uses the stacks up
do hu stop
as gm .aura 59756
waitfor hu aura 59756 timeout 2s
do hu goto -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do hu approach d1 15
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do hu cast 49050 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 49050 maxtargets == 1
expect hu noaura 900541

log MM - 900540 at 5 stacks (+250 %) the Aimed Shot pierces: every enemy in a line from the hunter through d1 within its range takes a hit of its own (on the line: d1 and the east-most dummy; the four 2.8 yd beside it count with the dummies' reach); the shot uses the stacks up
as gm .aura 900541
waitfor hu aura 900541 timeout 2s
as gm .aura stack 900541 4
expect hu aurastacks 900541 == 5
expect hu spellmod 49050 damage 100 == 350
spelllog start
do hu cast 49050 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 49050 maxtargets >= 2
expect hu spell 49050 hits <= 8
expect hu noaura 900541
as gm .unlearn 900540

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Survival
log Survival - 900568 Blade and Shot: physical shot damage stacks Blade Readiness (900569, +5 % melee weapon damage) - a Multi-Shot's three hits: three stacks, no Shot Readiness (900570)
do hu learn 900568
as gm .unaura 900569
as gm .unaura 900570
do hu cast 49048 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
expect hu aurastacks 900569 >= 2
expect hu noaura 900570

log Survival - 900568 a melee hit (Raptor Strike) uses Blade Readiness up and stacks Shot Readiness (+5 % ranged weapon damage)
do hu approach d1
wait 300ms
do hu cast 48996 on d1 triggered
wait 700ms
expect hu noaura 900569
expect hu aurastacks 900570 >= 1

log Survival - 900568 the next shot uses Shot Readiness up and stacks Blade Readiness again
do hu approach d1 15
wait 300ms
do hu cast 49048 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
expect hu noaura 900570
expect hu aura 900569
as gm .unlearn 900568
as gm .unaura 900569
as gm .unaura 900570

log Survival - 900571 / 900572 Raptor Strike +9 targets (jump targets 0 -> 10, a melee chain in front of you) and +50 % damage (from the west of d1, facing the ring)
do hu learn 900571
do hu learn 900572
expect hu spellmod 48996 jumptargets 0 == 10
expect hu spellmod 48996 damage 100 == 150
do hu approach d1
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do hu cast 48996 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 48996 maxtargets >= 6
expect hu spell 48996 hits <= 8

log Survival - 900566 explosive trap on physical damage, melee included: each hit 15 % (2 s cooldown), the Explosive Trap Effect of the hunter's rank (49065) goes off at the struck enemy and hits the ring - four Raptor Strikes on the ring (about 8 hits each) 2.5 s apart, statistical (P(no trap) below 1 %)
do hu learn 900566
spelllog start
do hu cast 48996 on d1 triggered
wait 2500ms
do hu cast 48996 on d1 triggered
wait 2500ms
do hu cast 48996 on d1 triggered
wait 2500ms
do hu cast 48996 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 49065 casts >= 1
expect hu spell 49065 targets >= 5
as gm .unlearn 900566
as gm .unlearn 900571
as gm .unlearn 900572

cleanup
do hu stop
do gm target hu
as gm .unaura 900541
as gm .unaura 900569
as gm .unaura 900570
as gm .unaura 59756
as gm .unaura 62627
as gm .unaura 3045
do hu destroy 2516
as gm .additem 2516 1000
as gm .unlearn 900500
as gm .unlearn 900501
as gm .unlearn 900502
as gm .unlearn 900503
as gm .unlearn 900504
as gm .unlearn 900507
as gm .unlearn 900533
as gm .unlearn 900534
as gm .unlearn 900537
as gm .unlearn 900538
as gm .unlearn 900539
as gm .unlearn 900540
as gm .unlearn 900566
as gm .unlearn 900568
as gm .unlearn 900571
as gm .unlearn 900572
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
